assertion  XBD.stdalign.h.001
anchor     basedefs/stdalign.h.html#DESCRIPTION/alignas
class      required
since      2024
says       alignas expands to _Alignas and alignof to _Alignof, and an alignas
           specifier aligns an object as asked.
test       t/001-align-macros.c
nomutant   run-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

assertion  XBD.stdalign.h.002
anchor     basedefs/stdalign.h.html#DESCRIPTION/__alignas_is_defined
class      required
since      2024
says       __alignas_is_defined and __alignof_is_defined expand to the integer
           constant 1 and are suitable for use in #if.
test       t/002-align-defined.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants
